  "description": "Independent Folio Commerce installer for Oqtane 10.0.0+. Includes the native 2sxc commerce app, seven store pages, native site theme mode and five optional storefront themes. Trial: one shop, 20 products including samples/child SKUs/archives, no expiry, local simulation only, no real payments or digital delivery, no editable source archive. Requires 2sxc. CISS Menu Builder and ACME are optional. Payment provider production acceptance remains an operator prerequisite.",
